### 1. Get all tasks
GET https://justin-cst8916-rest-api-c5ajf2hmeaetcwcn.northcentralus-01.azurewebsites.net/tasks

###

### 2. Get a single task
GET https://justin-cst8916-rest-api-c5ajf2hmeaetcwcn.northcentralus-01.azurewebsites.net/tasks/1

###

### 3. Get a task that does not exist
GET https://justin-cst8916-rest-api-c5ajf2hmeaetcwcn.northcentralus-01.azurewebsites.net/tasks/999

###

### 4. Create a new task - valid data
POST https://justin-cst8916-rest-api-c5ajf2hmeaetcwcn.northcentralus-01.azurewebsites.net/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Complete Assignment 1",
    "description": "Test the REST API",
    "user_id": 1,
    "completed": false
}

###

### 5. Create a task - missing title
POST https://justin-cst8916-rest-api-c5ajf2hmeaetcwcn.northcentralus-01.azurewebsites.net/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "user_id": 1,
    "completed": false
}

###

### 6. Create a task - invalid user_id
POST https://justin-cst8916-rest-api-c5ajf2hmeaetcwcn.northcentralus-01.azurewebsites.net/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Invalid User Task",
    "user_id": 999,
    "completed": false
}

###

### 7. Update a task
PUT https://justin-cst8916-rest-api-c5ajf2hmeaetcwcn.northcentralus-01.azurewebsites.net/tasks/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Updated Task",
    "completed": true,
    "user_id": 1
}

###

### 8. Delete a task
DELETE https://justin-cst8916-rest-api-c5ajf2hmeaetcwcn.northcentralus-01.azurewebsites.net/tasks/2

###

### 9. Get tasks for a specific user
GET https://justin-cst8916-rest-api-c5ajf2hmeaetcwcn.northcentralus-01.azurewebsites.net/users/1/tasks